		(property "Note" "I2C1 PB6/PB7 = the Pi-facing bus, also the system bootloader's I2C1 (AN2606 Table 105, target 0x56). PA14 = SWCLK and BOOT0. Program option bytes once over SWD: nBOOT_SEL=0 (BOOT0 pin honoured), hardware IWDG on. Internal pull-ups replace external ones (trimmed 2026-10-13) on PB9 SMBALERT, PB8 PFO, PA5 BUTTON, PB4 CAN RXD (the wake signal) and PC14 BUCK_PG; drop the PC14 pull-up while parked, because PGOOD sits low with the buck off. PA8 drives GPIO6 open-drain. Spare pins: PA1-PA3, PB1, PB2, PC6, PC15."
			(at 53.34 81.28 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
